   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "If by giving up material happiness"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "one sees abundant happiness,"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "the attentive would give up material happiness,"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "seeing the abundant happiness."
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Seeking their own happiness"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "by imposing suffering on others,"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "intimate with enmity,"
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "they’re not freed from enmity."
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "They dump what should be done,"
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "and do what should not be done."
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "For the insolent and the negligent,"
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "their defilements only grow."
    },
    {
     "n": 13,
     "text": "Those that have properly undertaken"
    },
    {
     "n": 14,
     "text": "constant mindfulness of the body,"
    },
    {
     "n": 15,
     "text": "don’t cultivate what should not be done,"
    },
    {
     "n": 16,
     "text": "but always do what should be done."
    },
    {
     "n": 17,
     "text": "Mindful and aware,"
    },
    {
     "n": 18,
     "text": "their defilements come to an end."
    },
    {
     "n": 19,
     "text": "Having slain mother and father,"
    },
    {
     "n": 20,
     "text": "and two aristocratic kings,"
    },
    {
     "n": 21,
     "text": "and having wiped out the kingdom with its tax collector,"
    },
    {
     "n": 22,
     "text": "the brahmin walks on untroubled."
    },
    {
     "n": 23,
     "text": "Having slain mother and father,"
    },
    {
     "n": 24,
     "text": "and two prosperous kings,"
    },
    {
     "n": 25,
     "text": "and a tiger as the fifth,"
    },
    {
     "n": 26,
     "text": "the brahmin walks on untroubled."
    },
    {
     "n": 27,
     "text": "The disciples of Gotama"
    },
    {
     "n": 28,
     "text": "always wake up refreshed,"
    },
    {
     "n": 29,
     "text": "who day and night"
    },
    {
     "n": 30,
     "text": "constantly recollect the Buddha."
    },
    {
     "n": 31,
     "text": "The disciples of Gotama"
    },
    {
     "n": 32,
     "text": "always wake up refreshed,"
    },
    {
     "n": 33,
     "text": "who day and night"
    },
    {
     "n": 34,
     "text": "constantly recollect the teaching."
    },
    {
     "n": 35,
     "text": "The disciples of Gotama"
    },
    {
     "n": 36,
     "text": "always wake up refreshed,"
    },
    {
     "n": 37,
     "text": "who day and night"
    },
    {
     "n": 38,
     "text": "constantly recollect the Saṅgha."
    },
    {
     "n": 39,
     "text": "The disciples of Gotama"
    },
    {
     "n": 40,
     "text": "always wake up refreshed,"
    },
    {
     "n": 41,
     "text": "who day and night"
    },
    {
     "n": 42,
     "text": "are constantly mindful of the body."
    },
    {
     "n": 43,
     "text": "The disciples of Gotama"
    },
    {
     "n": 44,
     "text": "always wake up refreshed,"
    },
    {
     "n": 45,
     "text": "whose minds day and night"
    },
    {
     "n": 46,
     "text": "delight in harmlessness."
    },
    {
     "n": 47,
     "text": "The disciples of Gotama"
    },
    {
     "n": 48,
     "text": "always wake up refreshed,"
    },
    {
     "n": 49,
     "text": "whose minds day and night"
    },
    {
     "n": 50,
     "text": "delight in meditation."
    },
    {
     "n": 51,
     "text": "Going forth is hard, it’s hard to be happy;"
    },
    {
     "n": 52,
     "text": "life at home is hard too, and painful,"
    },
    {
     "n": 53,
     "text": "it’s painful to stay when you’ve nothing in common."
    },
    {
     "n": 54,
     "text": "A traveler is a prey to pain,"
    },
    {
     "n": 55,
     "text": "so don’t be a traveler,"
    },
    {
     "n": 56,
     "text": "don’t be prey to pain."
    },
    {
     "n": 57,
     "text": "One who is faithful, accomplished in ethics,"
    },
    {
     "n": 58,
     "text": "blessed with fame and wealth,"
    },
    {
     "n": 59,
     "text": "is honored in whatever place"
    },
    {
     "n": 60,
     "text": "they frequent."
    },
    {
     "n": 61,
     "text": "The good shine from afar,"
    },
    {
     "n": 62,
     "text": "like the Himalayan peaks,"
    },
    {
     "n": 63,
     "text": "but the wicked are not seen,"
    },
    {
     "n": 64,
     "text": "like arrows scattered in the night."
    },
    {
     "n": 65,
     "text": "Sitting alone, sleeping alone,"
    },
    {
     "n": 66,
     "text": "tirelessly wandering alone;"
    },
    {
     "n": 67,
     "text": "one who tames themselves alone"
    },
    {
     "n": 68,
     "text": "would delight within a forest."
    }
